[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    57[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    58[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `c_src/CMakeLists.txt` builds only `add_library(driver SHARED ...)` — there is no
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    59[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `add_executable`, so the project produces **no driver binary**. The
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    60[0m:[38;5;10m[49m stdout-comparison requirement is instead satisfied by the `examples/harness`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    61[0m:[38;5;10m[49m runner, which is spawned once per row against the C `.so` and once against the
